        </style><div xmlns="" class="content_block"><div class="above-header">СанПиН (Санитарные правила и нормы) Главного госсанврача от 23.04.2020 № СанПиН 0372-20</div><h2 class="auth__title">Временные санитарные правила и нормы по организации деятельности государственных органов и иных организаций, а также субъектов предпринимательства в условиях пандемии COVID-19</h2><div id="documentBody" class="content-common"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/6075/bssPhr1/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/6075/dfasyegoee/"></a><img alt="" class="inimg" id="i1" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/-16378339/"></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/6075/bssPhr2/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/6075/dfas5cqghg/"></a><img alt="" class="inimg" id="i2" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/-16378340/"></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/6075/bssPhr3/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/6075/dfass1dxd2/"></a><img alt="" class="inimg" id="i3" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/-16378341/"></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/6075/bssPhr4/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="4" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr4"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/6075/dfas34wm0z/"></a><img alt="" class="inimg" id="i4" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/-16378342/"></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/6075/bssPhr5/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="5" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr5"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/6075/dfasvp1sa3/"></a><img alt="" class="inimg" id="i5" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/2